      <title>入门：计算机的基本构成</title>
      <link>https://blog.zhx589.top/posts/2025-08-24-%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90/</link>
